  "description": "Legend has it that a man with black hair and red eyes will bring ruin to Den Helder’s royal family. Because he was born with these features, Rayton is shunned by the palace as “the cursed one.“ When the vengeful prince stages a bloody coup detat years later, the powerless youngest princess, Setz, also dies by his sword.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: KToon, [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000064563), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/attached_doll)  \nR15: KToon\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[Japanese](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/314390/)",
